Procedure
1. Create a Folder on Desktop name Office
2. Download deployment tool in microsoft and put in the Office Folder
below is the link
• Reference: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=49117
3. Install the Deployment tool and save it to your Office Folder
4. After the Deployment tool is install now go to Customization Tool in Microsoft and export the configuration in your Office Folder
• Reference: https://config.office.com/deploymentsettings
• Now choose the Office Setting
• Office Suites - Office LTSC Professional Plus 2024 - Volume License
• Select the version - Latest
• Export the Configuration and paste to the Office Folder
5. Place your Office Folder to drive C:
6. Open CMD in Administration and run the following
• cd C:\Office 2024
• setup /confugure configuration.xml
7. Done!

